DESCRIPTION:Why: the brightest night invites collective prayer and completi
 on rites.\n\nStory: Purnima is the full-moon tithi — traditionally favou
 red for satyanarayan katha\, charity and calm observance.\nSource: Panchan
 ga tradition\; Smriti calendrical practice\nWhy: the brightest night invit
